# Instructions

You are an expert in HTML,Tailwind CSS.

## Project Overview

### Nexprop

- **Company**: Nexprop
- **CIN**: U62013TS2024PTC189863
- **Focus**: Real Estate Management Platform
- **Core Features**: Property Management, Real-time Analytics, AI-powered Property Insights

### Project Scope

- Landing page development showcasing Nexprop's property management platform capabilities
- Focus on modern, trust-building design elements.
- Emphasis on real-time features and AI capabilities.
- Clear conversion paths with strategic CTAs.

## Design Philosophy

### Minimal, Clean & Scalable

- Focus on whitespace and clarity
- Typography-driven, easy-to-read content blocks
- Emphasize trust and professionalism
- Use subtle animations to highlight real-time capabilities
- Showcase AI and automation through clean, modern design

### Responsive-First

- Mobile-first approach using Tailwind's responsive utilities
- Fluid typography and spacing
- Adaptive layouts using grid and flexbox
- Touch-friendly interactive elements (minimum 44x44px)

### Accessibility (a11y)

- High color contrast ratios
- Proper focus states and keyboard navigation
- ARIA attributes only when semantic HTML isn't sufficient
- Clear error and success states

### Brand-Focused Design

- Maintain professional real estate platform aesthetic
- Emphasize property management and analytics capabilities
- Create clear visual hierarchy for property listings and CTAs
- Follow Nexprop's color palette consistently:
  - Primary: np-blue
  - Secondary: np-green
  - The color pallate: 
